.work/
# Bulky or regenerable profiler output: raw profiles, folded stacks, per-request traces, fetched
# pages. The committed results keep the rendered flamegraphs (.svg), rollups (.top.md, .txt) and
# JSON summaries.
results/**/raw/
results/**/*.folded
results/**/trace-*.txt
results/**/io-*.log
results/**/*.html
__pycache__/
# bench/run's per-run scratch beside the results JSON (memory samples, per-phase process memory, loadgen stderr).
results/**/.*
